meta {
  name: Update Film
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{API_URL}}/film/{{FILM_ID}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{CLERK_TOKEN}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "rating": 8,
    "owned": false
  }
}

docs {
  Updates a film's rating, owned status and/or review.

  Requires CLERK_TOKEN (returns 401 without it).

  Fields:
  - rating: whole number (1-10) or null to clear rating
  - owned: boolean
  - review: string, or null or "" to clear the review

  Watched status is automatically derived from rating:
  - If rating has a value (1-10) → watched = true
  - If rating is null → watched = false (and rating is cleared)

  If rating is included in the body, this triggers cascading updates to:
  1. All associated directors' statistics
  2. Year statistics for the film's release year
  3. The top films list, when the film moves into, out of or between the 8-10 tiers
  4. The statistics of every actor in the film's cast

  Set the FILM_ID environment variable to test this endpoint.
}
